Package: actmon-agent
Version: 1.1.2
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.5), python3-pymysql, python3-psycopg2, python3-pymssql, python3-pymongo, python3-cryptography, python3-pip, procps, curl | wget
Recommends: python3-oracledb, python3-clickhouse-driver
Maintainer: ActMon <support@actmon.local>
Description: ActMon Host Monitoring Agent
 Lightweight agent that collects host CPU and memory metrics AND monitors
 databases running on this host (connects to localhost — no network exposure),
 pushing everything to the ActMon platform. Runs as a systemd service.
 The installer accepts ACTMON_ACCESS_TOKEN / ACTMON_URL from the environment
 to configure and start the service in one step.
